Z||000000||84fieroman||07-09-2001||12:51 PM||||Illumination in factory radio not working.  Is there a bulb inside to change?||||reg||5
Z||000001||fierohoho||07-09-2001||01:56 PM||||There are several bulbs inside the radio. <P>You will have to pull it and remove the front face plate (do this carefully as the tabs on the corners break easily). <P>There is a clear piece of plastic that sits over the bulbs to help distribute the light. <P>The bulbs are the same as the ones in the ashtray lights. <P>I think there are 3 bulbs, if you have the equalizer this does not have a bulb to illuminate the equilizer controls. <P>Once you get it apart replace all the bulbs to save yourself the hassle of an old one going out later. <P>Good luck.<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l||||reg||1
